"{\n  \"AND\": {\n    \"left\": {\n      \"AND\": {\n        \"left\": {\n          \"AND\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"AND\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"AND\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Diagnosis of PHN\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"DN, CRPS, carpal tunnel syndrome, HIV neuropathy, idiopathic sensory neuropathy, or other peripheral neuropathy\"\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"Pain >3 months after rash healing (for PHN patients)\"\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"OR\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"Type I or II diabetes and painful distal symmetric sensorimotor polyneuropathy with or without dynamic allodynia of the lower extremities (for DN patients)\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Current IASP diagnostic criteria (for CRPS patients)\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"OR\": {\n                        \"left\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"Diagnosis by combination clinical neurological examination, electrodiagnostic testing, and daily painful symptoms of at least 3 months' duration (for carpal tunnel syndrome patients)\"\n                        },\n                        \"right\": {\n                          \"OR\": {\n                            \"left\": {\n                              \"raw_text\": \"HIV, subjective symptoms of painful peripheral neuropathy, and daily painful symptoms of at least 3 months' duration (for HIV neuropathy patients)\"\n                            },\n                            \"right\": {\n       